{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46125","headline":"送刘相公朝觐二首 一 · 贯休","name":"送刘相公朝觐二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九苞仙瑞曜垂衣，一品高标百辟师。\n魏相十思常自切，曹溪一句几生知。\n久交玉帐虽难别，须佐金轮去已迟。\n唯杜荆州最惆怅，柳门回首落花时。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46125.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46125","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}